{"ref":"BDB, אֱלִישׁוּעַ","hw":"אֱלִישׁוּעַ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִישׁוּעַ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>God is salvation</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֱלִישָׁע\" href=\"/BDB,_אֱלִישָׁע\", dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִישָׁע</a> infr.; or <em>is opulence</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֲבִישׁוּעַ\" href=\"/BDB,_אֲבִישׁוּעַ\", dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִישׁוּעַ</a><strong>)</strong> son of David <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.15\">2 S 5:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 14:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.14.5\">1 Ch 14:5</a>.","next":"BDB, אֶלְיָשִׁיב","prev":"BDB, אֱלִישֶׁ֫בַע"}